            "short_description": "FortiGate delivers top-rated cloud security with network and application protection, VPN connectivity, and SD-WAN, available through and supported by IBM.",
            "long_description": "Fortinet FortiGate Next Generation Firewall (NGFW), available through and supported by IBM, provides comprehensive protection and automated security management for consistent policy enforcement and visibility. FortiGate combines application-aware network security, VPN (SSL or IPSec), SD-WAN, virus and malware protection, IPS, and Web filtering with advanced capabilities including an extreme threat database, vulnerability management, and flow-based inspection. FortiGate NGFW integrates with AI-driven FortiGuard and FortiSandbox services to help protect against known and zero-day threats. For centralized security management and analytics, FortiGate can be used with FortiManager and FortiAnalyzer.",
            "provider_name": "Fortinet Inc.",
            "offering_docs_url": "https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/licensed-firewall",
            "offering_icon_url": "https://fortinet.s3.us.cloud-object-storage.appdomain.cloud/Fortinet.png",
            "features": [
                {
                    "title": "Secure Connectivity",
                    "description": "Enable scalable remote access VPN (SSL or IPSec) to Azure-based workloads. SD-WAN built in."
                },
                {
                    "title": "Advanced Threat Protection",
                    "description": "FortiGate identifies and stops threats with powerful application control, malware protection, web filtering, antivirus\nand IPS technology"
                },
                {
                    "title": "Top-rated Performance",
                    "description": "Top-rated security effectiveness and performance as certified by independent testing. Fortinet is a Leader in the Gartner Magic Quadrant"
                }
